{"sourceUrl":"https://wenfa.ustb.edu.cn/xydt/tzgg/a21632c64f5b46e5a8a2cafc01753676.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:32.960858+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://wenfa.ustb.edu.cn/xydt/tzgg/a21632c64f5b46e5a8a2cafc01753676.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>一、学院简介</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>文法学院积极倡导</span><span>“</span><span>宽容与和谐</span></span><span><span>”“</span></span><span><span>学习与研究</span><span>”</span><span>的精神，注重基础教学与专业教学并进、理论教学与实践教学并行、教育教学与科学研究并重，不断为社会主义建设培养复合型、应用型的拔尖创新人才。</span></span><span><span>学院拥有公共管理</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>、法学、社会学一级学科硕士学位授予权以及公共管理硕士（</span>MPA<span>）、法律硕士（</span><span>JM</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>社会工作硕士（</span>MSW<span>）</span></span><span><span>和教育硕士（</span></span><span>M.Ed</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>专业学位授予权。多年来，学院依托优秀的师资队伍、优质的办学条件和办学资源，积累了丰富的教学管理经验，形成了完善的制度体系和成功的培养模式，为相关部门、行业输送了大批优秀人才。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、</span></span><span><span>申请</span></span><span><span>资格</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申报</span></span><span><span>对象：</span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>届本科毕业生，成绩优异，已获得推荐免试资格或有望获得推荐免试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>拥护中国共产党领导</span></span><span><span>，拥护社会主义制度，竭诚为社会主义现代化建设服务；道德品质良好，遵纪守法，身体健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>英语水平良好，大学期间无不及格科目</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>对拟申报的专业具有浓厚兴趣，具备攻读硕士研究生的基本能力和素质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、接收推免生预报名的专业</span></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业代码</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>硕士类型</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>说明</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030100</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>法学</span></span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span><span>学术型硕士</span></span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span><span>仅接收外语语种为英语的推免生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030300</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>社会学</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>120400</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>公共管理</span></span><span><span>学</span><span>(</span></span><span>01</span><span><span>方向</span></span><span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>120400</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>公共管理</span></span><span><span>学</span><span>(</span></span><span>02</span><span><span>方向</span></span><span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>035101</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>法律</span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>非法学</span></span><span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span><span>专业学位硕士</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>本科所学专业为非法学专业</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>仅接收外语语种为英语的推免生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>035102</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>法律</span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>法学</span></span><span><span>)</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>本科所学专业为法学专业</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>仅接收外语语种为英语的推免生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>035200</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>社会工作</span></span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>仅接收外语语种为英语的推免生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>045100</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>教育</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><span>注：专业招生情况以发布</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年硕士学位研究生招生简章及招生专业目录为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、申请流程</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span><span>即日起至</span></span><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span><span>4</span></span></strong><strong><span>:00</span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>过期不再接受申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>报名方式：凡有意向申请者，包括本校生源在内，均须通过我校研究生报考服务系统申请报名。申请者可点击以下链接进入报名系统：</span></span><span>https://yjsy.ustb.edu.cn/ksxt/logon</span><span><span>，招生项目选择</span><span>“202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年推免生预报名</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>进行账号注册，</span></span><span><span>填写报名信息</span></span><span><span>（建议使用谷歌浏览器），并在学院公布的期限内报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>必须提供的材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span>P</span><span>DF<span>格式</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）身份证（正反面）扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）学生证（照片页和注册页）扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）本科前三年成绩单及成绩排名扫描件</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>需加盖教务处或院系公章</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）</span></span><span><span>能够体现申请者外</span></span><span><span>语水平</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>证明材料（</span></span><span><span>英语四</span>/<span>六级成绩单或其他如</span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span>TOEFL<span>、</span><span>GRE</span></span><span>/GMAT</span><span><span>成绩等）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）对申</span></span><span><span>请有参考价值的个人陈述</span></span><span><span>（限</span>1000<span>字以内）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span><span>其他材料（如无可不提交）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>包括论文或专利等学术成果，各类竞赛获奖、荣誉称号等证书</span></span><span><span>，以</span></span><span><span>及其他可体现个人素质和能力的材料</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、材料</span></span><span><span>评议</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将在</span></span><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>报名截止后，设立申请材料初审工作组，负责对考生申报材料开展评议审核，确定考生综合考核（复试）入围资格，申请人可登录推免系统查看审核结果，材料不符合要求者将被退回修改，请于规定时间重新上传，逾期视为自愿放弃。此外，通过审核者应在规定时间内及时在系统内缴纳</span>100<span>元复试费并确认参加复试，未在规定时间内缴纳费用及确认参加复试的，视为自愿放弃。缴纳预推免复试费后，如因个人原因未按时参加预复试的，已缴复试费不予退还。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、考核安排及内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院拟于</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>上旬</span></span><span><span>开展预推免面试，</span></span><span><span>面试具体时间安排</span></span><span><span>和</span></span><span><span>会议信息</span></span><span><span>将通过我院官网（</span>https://wenfa.ustb.edu.cn/<span>）或提前</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span>2<span>日</span></span><span><span>短信通知</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>请各位考生在报名时务必认真填写正确的手机号码，如因号码有误或者未在规定时</span></span><span><span>间内</span></span><span><span>在线导致没有按时参加面试的，视为自动放弃预</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考核内容：考核满分为</span>250<span>分，</span><span>150</span><span>分为合格，其中：外语水平满分</span><span>50</span><span>分，合格分为</span><span>30</span><span>分；专业水平满分</span><span>100</span><span>分，合格分为</span><span>60</span><span>分；综合素质满分</span><span>100</span><span>分，合格分为</span><span>60</span><span>分。专业水平考核、或综合素质考核、或外语水平考核、或复试总成绩低于满分的</span><span>60%</span><span>，视为复试不合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试结果（合格或不合格）考生可通过北京科技大学研究生招生管理信息系统查看。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、注意事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>通过我院预推免面试考核的考生，在获得推免资格之后务必按照教育部要求在规定时间内登录中国研招网</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（网址</span></span><a href=\"https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm%EF%BC%89%E5%A1%AB%E6%8A%A5%E5%BF%97%E6%84%BF%EF%BC%8C%E7%BD%91%E4%B8%8A%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%B9%B6%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%88%91%E9%99%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%8D%E8%AF%95%E5%8F%8A%E5%BE%85%E5%BD%95%E5%8F%96%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%AD%89%E7%8E%AF%E8%8A%82%E3%80%82%E6%9C%AA%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E6%8E%A8%E5%85%8D%E8%B5%84%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%E8%80%83%E7%94%9F%E5%92%8C%E6%9C%AA%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%A0%94%E6%8B%9B%E7%BD%91/%E2%80%9C%E6%8E%A8%E5%85%8D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E2%80%9D%E6%8A%A5%E5%90%8D%E5%92%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%BE%85%E5%BD%95%E5%8F%96%E7%9A%84%E8%80%83%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%8C%E9%A2%84%E6%8E%A8%E5%85%8D%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E3%80%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm<span>）填报志愿，网上完成接收并确认我院的</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>及待录取通知等环节。未获得推免资格的考生和未通过中国研招网</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>报名和接受待录取的考生，预</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>考核结果一律无效。</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>必须提交的材料上传不全者，报名将不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>若发现申请材料有虚假成分，即取消申请人一切由此获得的利益，并保留追溯的权利。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span><span>请各位考生及时关注系统及学院官网发布的相关信息。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：北京市海淀区学院路</span>30<span>号北京科技大学</span></span><span><span>文法学院（</span></span><span><span>文法楼</span></span><span><span>207</span><span>室）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：李老师</span></span><span>  <span>乔老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>010-62333011</span><span>  010-62332752</span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱：</span> </span><span>wfyz</span><span>@ustb.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>学院网址：</span><a href=\"http://wenfa.ustb.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://wenfa.ustb.edu.cn/</span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>文法学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免和考研咨询<span>1</span>群</span></span><span><span>：</span><span>954873294</span></span><span><span>（满员请加<span>2</span>群：<span>786657023</span></span></span><span>）</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>进群申请请注明姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科院校</span><span>+</span><span>专业</span></p>\n<p><span>九、监督投诉</span><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：北京市海淀区学院路</span>30<span>号北京科技大学</span></span><span><span>文法学院党委办公室（文法楼</span><span>203</span><span>室）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>张</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>010-6233</span><span>4218</span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱：</span> </span><span>wf</span><span><span>dw</span></span><span>@ustb.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>北京科技大学文法学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2026</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>8</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>2</span><span>5</span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"3a480901ea97dced45cc4d4f27da9d45980c7d22ed2188032ba981931f4caa93","textLength":2178,"sourceSha256":"f832291f7eabb22fb62455b7557a56a685355549ceb7e144236e360a7aab75a1","selector":"article-like:detailsArticle","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-86d83131770a28931e5a","title":"2026年北京科技大学文法学院接收2027年全日制硕士推免生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:32.960858+00:00"}
